\`\`\`

If there is no index on \`age\`, you will see a \`SCAN TABLE\` (Full Scan). 
If you create an index:
\`\`\`sql
CREATE INDEX idx_user_age ON users(age);
\`\`\`
The plan will change to \`SEARCH TABLE\` using the index!

